<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Girlfriend's Day ❤️</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4b91,#ff85a2);
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
height:100vh;
overflow:hidden;
}

.container{
text-align:center;
color:white;
padding:20px;
animation:fade 1.5s;
z-index:2;
}

h1{
font-size:40px;
margin:15px 0;
text-shadow:0 0 10px white;
}

.photo{
width:230px;
height:230px;
border-radius:50%;
border:6px solid white;
object-fit:cover;
box-shadow:0 0 20px white;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
margin-top:20px;
line-height:1.6;
}

.bigheart{
font-size:70px;
animation:beat 1s infinite;
}

.heart{
position:absolute;
font-size:25px;
animation:float 7s linear infinite;
}

@keyframes beat{
0%{transform:scale(1);}
50%{transform:scale(1.2);}
100%{transform:scale(1);}
}

@keyframes fade{
from{opacity:0;}
to{opacity:1;}
}

@keyframes float{
0%{
transform:translateY(100vh);
opacity:0;
}
20%{
opacity:1;
}
100%{
transform:translateY(-100vh);
opacity:0;
}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="bigheart">❤️</div>

<h1>Happy Girlfriend's Day</h1>

<img "photo" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dtz0urit6/image/upload/q_auto:best,f_jpg/cloudinary-tools-uploads/d3gdolx2uozngmowxftz">

<p>
You are the most beautiful part of my life ❤️<br><br>
Thank you for always making me smile.<br>
I Love You Forever ❤️
</p>

</div>

<script>
function heart(){
let h=document.createElement("div");
h.className="heart";
h.innerHTML="❤️";
h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
h.style.fontSize=(20+Math.random()*30)+"px";
h.style.animationDuration=(4+Math.random()*4)+"s";
document.body.appendChild(h);

setTimeout(()=>{
h.remove();
},8000);
}
setInterval(heart,250);
</script>

</body>
</html>
